                                By <a class="post-font" href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/">King of Digital Marketing</a> &bull; <i class="fa fa-calendar-alt"></i> September 10, 2026 &bull; <i class="fa fa-clock"></i> 8 Min Read
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                            <a href="#"><img src="img/WordPress website in easy steps.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="Google March 2024 Core Update" /></a><br>
                            <div class="cus-bullet">
                                <h4>TABLE OF CONTENT</h4>
                                <li><a href="#1">Decide the Right Hosting Provider That Suit the requirements of the Business</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#2">Install WordPress</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#3">Select a subject matter.</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#4">Make Your Website Unique</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#5">Add Content</a></li>
